Package: scSynRep
Title: Generate Synthetic Single-Cell RNA-seq Replicates from Bulk RNA-seq Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Chengfeng", "Jiang", email = "chengfeng@ucla.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A pipeline for generating synthetic single-cell RNA-seq replicates 
    by integrating bulk RNA-seq distribution fitting with scDesign3-based 
    single-cell modeling. The package filters and preprocesses both bulk and 
    single-cell data, fits multivariate distributions to bulk expression, 
    models single-cell expression using copulas, and generates synthetic 
    replicates that preserve biological variation.
